  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Verified behaviour",
      "items": [
        "start_job is a chat tool (not offered inside a job); it queues assistant_task at chat priority, as the member.",
        "run_job runs the same agent loop with the higher job tool-call cap and Verify: after write tools, run_validation checks the proposals and the loop fixes errors for a few rounds.",
        "Checkpoints after each step: a job whose worker dies resumes without repeating finished tool calls (up to 3 runs, see the job lifecycle)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Errors and endings",
      "items": [
        "The member can no longer sign in, or a refusal (budget, internal-only): the job fails with a message in its log.",
        "cancelled: a message 'No changes were proposed' is posted; failed: same, with the reason.",
        "A refused Change Set fails the job; otherwise the collected changes become exactly one Change Set to review."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Conditional / simplified",
      "items": [
        "Supervisor mode (setting assistant_job_supervisor): the job plans (write_plan) and delegates parts to specialists, each its own run_agent; a specialist's question pauses the job the same way.",
        "The member's answer goes through the jobs API (JobService.answer); the UI path to it was not traced in detail."
      ]
    }
  ]
